---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use — Screen Sharing Remote"
  description="Terms of use for the Screen Sharing Remote iPhone app."
>
  <main class="wrap">
    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: November 10, 2026</p>

    <h2>The app</h2>
    <p>
      Screen Sharing Remote is an iPhone client for Apple's Screen Sharing protocol. You may
      only use it to connect to computers you own or are authorized to control.
    </p>

    <h2>License</h2>
    <p>
      The app's source code is free software, published under the GNU General Public License
      v3. You can read, build, and modify it from the
      <a href="https://github.com/iherdt/screen-sharing-remote">GitHub repository</a>. The
      App Store purchase covers the convenience of the prebuilt, signed, and updated app.
    </p>

    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>
      The app is provided as is, without warranty of any kind, to the extent permitted by law.
      See the GPLv3 for the full warranty disclaimer.
    </p>

    <h2>Trademarks</h2>
    <p>
      Mac, iPhone, and Apple are trademarks of Apple Inc. Screen Sharing Remote is an
      independent app and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Apple Inc.
    </p>

    <p class="back"><a href="/">← Back to Screen Sharing Remote</a></p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .wrap {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 64px 20px 80px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .updated {
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin: 26px 0 8px;
  }
  p {
    color: var(--text-2);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .back {
    margin-top: 36px;
  }
</style>
